1
00:00:07,040 --> 00:00:08,920
‪SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

2
00:01:35,200 --> 00:01:38,920
‪ADAPTED FROM <i>‪JIA JIN CHAI</i>‪, ORIGINAL NOVEL
‪BY XIAOJIAREN ON JINJIANG LITERATURE CITY

3
00:01:42,000 --> 00:01:43,880
XIANZHUANG

4
00:01:43,960 --> 00:01:45,680
We weren't expecting a visit
from Your Grace at this hour.

5
00:01:45,760 --> 00:01:47,080
Maternal Grandmother
meant to greet you herself.

6
00:01:47,800 --> 00:01:49,040
But something came up at the estate.

7
00:01:49,880 --> 00:01:51,280
Please forgive the discourtesy.

8
00:01:51,360 --> 00:01:53,360
I meant to arrive before the Xu hour.

9
00:01:53,440 --> 00:01:55,600
But the heavy rain slowed us down.
Our carriage got stuck in the mud.

10
00:01:55,680 --> 00:01:58,480
Enough of that.
Take me to your maternal grandmother.

11
00:01:59,280 --> 00:02:02,120
- This way, please.
- Mother, watch your step.

12
00:02:02,200 --> 00:02:04,880
XIANZHUANG

13
00:02:07,480 --> 00:02:09,720
You want me to spare those two vile women?

14
00:02:11,120 --> 00:02:14,080
They kept Rao and me apart for decades.

15
00:02:14,160 --> 00:02:16,920
They tried multiple times
to turn us against each other.

16
00:02:17,000 --> 00:02:19,760
I would gladly see them
put to death by a thousand cuts.

17
00:02:21,360 --> 00:02:22,200
No.

18
00:02:22,840 --> 00:02:25,200
Even if the Duchess yourself
pleads for them,

19
00:02:26,120 --> 00:02:27,360
I will never forgive them.

20
00:02:28,080 --> 00:02:31,040
Your Ladyship,
it's precisely for Rao's sake

21
00:02:31,120 --> 00:02:33,600
that we cannot openly
have them sentenced to death.

22
00:02:33,680 --> 00:02:37,080
Noble Lady Wu'an just received her title.
She's already drawn plenty of envy.

23
00:02:38,080 --> 00:02:41,600
If we hand Lady Heng'e and Lady Guo
over to the authorities,

24
00:02:41,680 --> 00:02:43,520
it may feel satisfying for the moment.

25
00:02:43,600 --> 00:02:46,600
But it will also expose Rao to gossip.

26
00:02:48,240 --> 00:02:50,640
Your Ladyship, I know it pains you
to see your daughter suffer.

27
00:02:51,160 --> 00:02:54,120
But if outsiders start questioning,
mocking her background,

28
00:02:54,200 --> 00:02:55,680
saying her father was a gambler

29
00:02:56,280 --> 00:02:57,440
and she even killed someone…

30
00:02:57,520 --> 00:03:00,160
Then we may blame the world for it.

31
00:03:00,240 --> 00:03:02,400
My daughter did nothing wrong.

32
00:03:04,520 --> 00:03:08,680
Of course we know Rao is innocent.

33
00:03:08,760 --> 00:03:11,800
But outsiders may not be so forgiving.

34
00:03:13,320 --> 00:03:15,480
You must think of her future.

35
00:03:16,120 --> 00:03:19,200
It's best to bury this matter for good.

36
00:03:20,160 --> 00:03:23,520
I just saw Wei Heng'e.

37
00:03:23,600 --> 00:03:26,640
She's lost her mind completely.

38
00:03:27,600 --> 00:03:31,320
We could simply have her strangled.

39
00:03:31,840 --> 00:03:35,760
But after all,
she's Old Madam Wei's own daughter

40
00:03:36,640 --> 00:03:38,520
and Rao's own aunt.

41
00:03:38,600 --> 00:03:40,880
If we kill her now,

42
00:03:40,960 --> 00:03:44,640
Rao's ties to the Wei family
will be severed for good.

43
00:03:45,920 --> 00:03:47,720
Xianzhuang is too close to the capital.

44
00:03:47,800 --> 00:03:48,920
Word could easily get out.

45
00:03:49,520 --> 00:03:51,080
Let me take her.

46
00:03:51,160 --> 00:03:54,480
She'll do hard labor
on the Lu family's northern estate

47
00:03:54,560 --> 00:03:56,040
and spend her life in exile.

48
00:03:56,120 --> 00:03:58,120
If we show her this mercy,

49
00:03:58,200 --> 00:04:01,120
the Wei family will be deeply grateful

50
00:04:01,200 --> 00:04:04,400
and repay Rao a thousandfold.

51
00:04:05,880 --> 00:04:07,200
As for Lady Guo…

52
00:04:07,280 --> 00:04:11,000
Since Duchess of Ying has pleaded for her,
I'll spare her life.

53
00:04:11,080 --> 00:04:14,680
DEEP CLOUDS, TWILIGHT SEAS

54
00:04:14,760 --> 00:04:16,480
But Lady Guo…

55
00:04:19,320 --> 00:04:20,880
I'll deal with her myself.

56
00:04:21,839 --> 00:04:24,040
What do you intend to do with her,
Your Ladyship?

57
00:04:26,600 --> 00:04:30,400
She'll serve at Zunshan Shrine for life,

58
00:04:31,160 --> 00:04:34,640
devoting each day to prayer and penance

59
00:04:35,240 --> 00:04:37,640
to atone for her sins.

60
00:05:05,800 --> 00:05:08,360
Noble Lady Wu'an has a high fever.
Get the physician, now.

61
00:05:09,040 --> 00:05:10,560
- Yes.
- Hurry!

62
00:05:15,960 --> 00:05:17,080
It's cold and pouring outside.

63
00:05:17,160 --> 00:05:18,840
Governess feared you might catch a chill.

64
00:05:18,920 --> 00:05:20,200
So she had ginger tea prepared.

65
00:05:27,160 --> 00:05:30,360
My Lord, you may not know how to do it.
Let me.

66
00:05:30,440 --> 00:05:31,360
Leave us.

67
00:05:36,880 --> 00:05:38,080
Are you killing me?

68
00:05:43,840 --> 00:05:47,760
I don't know how much you've suffered,
but I can imagine.

69
00:05:47,840 --> 00:05:50,840
Don't act like you know everything.
How much do you really know?

70
00:05:55,360 --> 00:05:57,240
The mother you longed to see…

71
00:06:00,120 --> 00:06:01,040
She let you down.

72
00:06:03,560 --> 00:06:05,480
No matter how many people
try to persuade you,

73
00:06:06,800 --> 00:06:08,240
you have every right not to forgive her.

74
00:06:10,360 --> 00:06:13,440
After all,
they never had to suffer like that.

75
00:06:13,960 --> 00:06:15,840
And they have no right
to tell you how to feel.

76
00:06:24,480 --> 00:06:25,880
But I want to ask you one thing.

77
00:06:28,160 --> 00:06:29,600
Will you give up your title
as Noble Lady Wu'an?

78
00:06:29,680 --> 00:06:30,680
Never.

79
00:06:31,280 --> 00:06:33,960
I earned this title myself.
I won't give it up for anyone.

80
00:06:37,760 --> 00:06:39,480
The title carries immense responsibility.

81
00:06:40,240 --> 00:06:43,080
Countless people under your rule
depend on your protection.

82
00:06:43,760 --> 00:06:47,440
You can be angry and disappointed.
You can grieve.

83
00:06:50,800 --> 00:06:52,280
But you only get tonight.

84
00:06:54,720 --> 00:06:55,600
What's in your mind?

85
00:07:01,920 --> 00:07:04,720
My birth mother
is the Emperor's beloved Lady Li.

86
00:07:06,800 --> 00:07:08,800
Now I can really throw my weight around.

87
00:07:11,800 --> 00:07:13,040
Well, impressive.

88
00:07:20,680 --> 00:07:22,720
- What are you doing?
- Try to put you to sleep.

89
00:07:24,080 --> 00:07:25,080
When my cousin was sick,

90
00:07:25,960 --> 00:07:26,880
Mother always did that.

91
00:07:30,600 --> 00:07:32,960
This feels awkward. Move away.

92
00:07:40,800 --> 00:07:42,880
My Lord, His Grace wants to see you.

93
00:07:46,880 --> 00:07:48,000
The physician is here.

94
00:07:48,080 --> 00:07:49,560
Give Her Ladyship
cold medicine before she sleeps.

95
00:07:50,360 --> 00:07:51,520
Yes.

96
00:08:03,080 --> 00:08:03,920
DUKE'S RESIDENCE

97
00:08:04,000 --> 00:08:05,320
Luckily, My Lady
took the medicine in time.

98
00:08:05,400 --> 00:08:06,280
Your fever's gone.

99
00:08:07,560 --> 00:08:08,680
Where's His Lordship?

100
00:08:12,000 --> 00:08:13,040
Tell me the truth.

101
00:08:13,120 --> 00:08:15,640
My Lady, His Lordship
went to His Grace's quarters last night.

102
00:08:15,720 --> 00:08:17,440
He never came back.

103
00:08:17,520 --> 00:08:21,240
The servants said the Duke punished him.

104
00:08:28,920 --> 00:08:30,000
Do you realise you were wrong?

105
00:08:32,799 --> 00:08:34,320
WANXIANG HALL

106
00:08:34,400 --> 00:08:35,280
Give it to me.

107
00:08:44,680 --> 00:08:45,800
What did I teach you?

108
00:08:46,600 --> 00:08:50,080
Your father and uncles
died fighting for our country!

109
00:08:50,160 --> 00:08:53,280
You're the Lu family's only hope
to carry on our legacy!

110
00:08:53,880 --> 00:08:56,080
- Do you remember that?
- I haven't forgotten!

111
00:08:58,560 --> 00:09:01,600
Your Grace. He's knelt all night
and taken forty lashes.

112
00:09:01,680 --> 00:09:03,080
He can't take any more.

113
00:09:03,160 --> 00:09:04,600
Your Grace, please calm down.
Don't hit him again.

114
00:09:04,680 --> 00:09:05,960
Please, Your Grace.

115
00:09:08,440 --> 00:09:11,040
Tell me. Yesterday, Qi Zhongkai

116
00:09:11,600 --> 00:09:14,000
led several censors
to block His Majesty's carriage.

117
00:09:14,720 --> 00:09:15,840
Was that your idea?

118
00:09:16,440 --> 00:09:18,040
His Majesty moved ahead the Grand Review.

119
00:09:18,560 --> 00:09:19,880
That already violated protocols!

120
00:09:19,960 --> 00:09:21,240
You still dare lie to me?

121
00:09:21,840 --> 00:09:23,840
You left your duties behind.
Where did you go?

122
00:09:24,600 --> 00:09:25,520
Lu Zhuo.

123
00:09:26,400 --> 00:09:28,440
You're my most trusted eldest grandson.

124
00:09:29,040 --> 00:09:31,160
From a young age,
you were upright and steady,

125
00:09:31,240 --> 00:09:32,320
careful in speech and firm in action.

126
00:09:32,920 --> 00:09:34,640
At thirteen,
you followed me into the army.

127
00:09:34,720 --> 00:09:37,720
led a thousand horsemen
into twenty thousand enemy troops,

128
00:09:37,800 --> 00:09:39,520
and still brought
back their commander's head.

129
00:09:40,120 --> 00:09:41,960
You were a hero without equal.

130
00:09:42,600 --> 00:09:47,240
I may have lost three sons,
but I still had you.

131
00:09:48,120 --> 00:09:50,880
You were my greatest pride,
the Lu family's only hope.

132
00:09:51,480 --> 00:09:53,360
How could you? How dare you?

133
00:09:54,440 --> 00:10:00,480
If you still call me Grandfather,
then tell me the truth.

134
00:10:01,320 --> 00:10:03,760
When you went
after the bandits on South Mountain,

135
00:10:03,840 --> 00:10:05,120
who did you really do it for?

136
00:10:06,920 --> 00:10:08,760
I fought them to keep the people safe.

137
00:10:09,600 --> 00:10:10,680
There's no need to ask more, Grandfather.

138
00:10:10,760 --> 00:10:13,800
You won't tell me?
Then I'll beat the truth out of you!

139
00:10:13,880 --> 00:10:16,600
- Stop! He can't take any more!
- Stop!

140
00:10:16,680 --> 00:10:18,320
- Move!
- Stop!

141
00:10:18,400 --> 00:10:19,560
- Please stop!
- Get out of my way!

142
00:10:19,640 --> 00:10:20,640
I'll beat him to death!

143
00:10:20,720 --> 00:10:21,840
If my son did wrong,

144
00:10:21,920 --> 00:10:24,040
it's because I, as his mother,
failed to educate him.

145
00:10:24,120 --> 00:10:26,200
Your Grace, punish me instead!

146
00:10:26,280 --> 00:10:27,160
Mother.

147
00:10:27,760 --> 00:10:29,760
- Move aside.
- No. No…

148
00:10:31,360 --> 00:10:33,160
Someone, pull Mother away!

149
00:10:34,960 --> 00:10:36,120
- No! No!
- Madam. Forgive us.

150
00:10:36,200 --> 00:10:37,680
- No!
- Forgive us, Madam.

151
00:10:37,760 --> 00:10:38,880
Let go of me!

152
00:10:39,760 --> 00:10:40,840
Enough!

153
00:10:41,400 --> 00:10:45,760
Mother, how am I supposed to live?

154
00:10:45,840 --> 00:10:47,320
- Please calm down, Your Grace!
- Don't hit him anymore.

155
00:10:47,400 --> 00:10:49,120
This is all my fault.

156
00:10:49,200 --> 00:10:50,520
Please don't blame His Lordship.

157
00:10:51,880 --> 00:10:52,840
What are you doing here?

158
00:10:53,840 --> 00:10:55,040
Go back.

159
00:11:01,960 --> 00:11:04,800
Traveling merchants are often harassed
by South Mountain bandits.

160
00:11:05,760 --> 00:11:07,080
The northern army
has repeatedly failed to stop them.

161
00:11:07,160 --> 00:11:08,720
His Lordship was upset when he heard.

162
00:11:09,320 --> 00:11:10,800
I was angry at the injustice,

163
00:11:10,880 --> 00:11:14,400
so I told him
the men who abducted me as a child

164
00:11:14,480 --> 00:11:16,360
were also bandits from South Mountain.

165
00:11:16,440 --> 00:11:18,840
That's why His Lordship
led troops against them.

166
00:11:18,920 --> 00:11:20,680
It's all my fault.

167
00:11:21,200 --> 00:11:23,080
I never should've told him.

168
00:11:25,440 --> 00:11:26,840
Please punish me as you see fit,
Your Grace!

169
00:11:26,920 --> 00:11:27,920
You…

170
00:11:32,400 --> 00:11:34,480
Enough, enough.

171
00:11:35,080 --> 00:11:39,920
Even His Majesty took the censors' advice
and returned to the palace.

172
00:11:40,520 --> 00:11:42,600
He didn't even punish the Lu family.

173
00:11:42,680 --> 00:11:44,960
So why are you so furious?

174
00:11:45,040 --> 00:11:47,600
Those South Mountain bandits
have plagued the area for years,

175
00:11:47,680 --> 00:11:49,720
harming countless people.

176
00:11:49,800 --> 00:11:51,520
Lu Zhuo wiped them out.

177
00:11:51,600 --> 00:11:54,160
That's good for the country
and the people.

178
00:11:54,760 --> 00:11:58,280
No matter how grave his mistake,
a whole night on his knees is enough.

179
00:11:58,880 --> 00:12:01,080
Rao, help Lu Zhuo back.

180
00:12:05,520 --> 00:12:06,800
Hurry.

181
00:12:17,160 --> 00:12:19,160
- My Lord. My Lord!
- Zhuo!

182
00:12:19,240 --> 00:12:22,000
- My Lord!
- Zhuo!

183
00:12:34,520 --> 00:12:35,520
Enough.

184
00:12:35,600 --> 00:12:39,240
Your son is only injured. He's not dying.

185
00:12:39,320 --> 00:12:40,680
Stop crying!

186
00:12:40,760 --> 00:12:42,000
You're giving me a headache.

187
00:12:49,160 --> 00:12:50,640
You heartless old fool.

188
00:12:50,720 --> 00:12:54,080
If anything happens to Lu Zhuo,
I'll never forgive you!

189
00:12:58,040 --> 00:13:00,160
I regret choosing the wrong woman for him.

190
00:13:00,240 --> 00:13:01,400
What do you mean?

191
00:13:02,000 --> 00:13:03,800
I knew at once who he was covering for.

192
00:13:04,560 --> 00:13:06,600
What he needs is a wife
who can run his household

193
00:13:06,680 --> 00:13:07,680
and manage the family estate,

194
00:13:07,760 --> 00:13:10,280
a proper principal wife
from a respectable family,

195
00:13:10,360 --> 00:13:13,560
not some celebrated Noble Lady
or a beautiful, seductive wife.

196
00:13:13,640 --> 00:13:14,720
Even worse, she is someone

197
00:13:14,800 --> 00:13:17,320
inciting the husband to neglect
his work and chase around her.

198
00:13:17,920 --> 00:13:19,080
I regret it now.

199
00:13:19,160 --> 00:13:21,640
I never should've arranged
his marriage with a Wei daughter.

200
00:13:23,400 --> 00:13:24,240
My Lady.

201
00:13:24,920 --> 00:13:26,640
Let me take the medicine in.

202
00:13:30,760 --> 00:13:33,480
Rao caught a chill yesterday.

203
00:13:34,200 --> 00:13:35,960
Zhuo has plenty of people tending to him.

204
00:13:36,040 --> 00:13:38,200
You should go back and rest.

205
00:13:38,800 --> 00:13:40,000
Thank you, Mother.

206
00:13:44,200 --> 00:13:46,240
I don't want His Lordship
catching my illness either.

207
00:13:48,320 --> 00:13:49,440
Thank you, Governess Miao.

208
00:13:50,280 --> 00:13:52,680
It's my duty. You needn't ask, My Lady.

209
00:14:02,720 --> 00:14:04,040
You're never satisfied.

210
00:14:04,840 --> 00:14:07,000
Have you forgotten when Lu Zhuo was dying,

211
00:14:07,600 --> 00:14:10,440
who kept her word
and married him to save his life?

212
00:14:10,520 --> 00:14:11,920
He'd finally recovered,

213
00:14:12,000 --> 00:14:14,040
and now you've beaten him half to death.

214
00:14:14,640 --> 00:14:16,960
And you still fault his wife
for being too beautiful?

215
00:14:17,040 --> 00:14:19,440
Have you forgotten how she risked her life
to defend our family

216
00:14:19,520 --> 00:14:20,560
at the ancestral temple?

217
00:14:20,640 --> 00:14:22,680
You stubborn old fool!

218
00:14:23,440 --> 00:14:24,600
You…

219
00:14:27,120 --> 00:14:28,000
Women's logic.

220
00:14:32,920 --> 00:14:33,840
Thank goodness.

221
00:14:34,680 --> 00:14:36,840
You're awake! Thank goodness.

222
00:14:43,400 --> 00:14:46,560
Your wife is sick too.

223
00:14:47,280 --> 00:14:49,040
So I sent her back to rest.

224
00:14:49,120 --> 00:14:51,760
If you want to see her, I'll send for her.

225
00:14:51,840 --> 00:14:53,040
No need.

226
00:14:53,960 --> 00:14:55,720
There's still much to do at the barracks.

227
00:14:55,800 --> 00:14:57,640
Lie down. Come on, lie down.

228
00:14:57,720 --> 00:15:00,560
You nearly died last time.

229
00:15:00,640 --> 00:15:04,520
You've barely recovered,
and now you've been whipped.

230
00:15:05,160 --> 00:15:09,280
The physician warned us again and again
that you mustn't overexert yourself.

231
00:15:09,960 --> 00:15:12,040
You absolutely cannot get up.

232
00:15:12,720 --> 00:15:14,880
Do you hear me? Stay in bed.

233
00:15:15,520 --> 00:15:16,920
- Don't get up.
- Exactly.

234
00:15:21,040 --> 00:15:21,880
Hopeless.

235
00:15:26,480 --> 00:15:27,840
Ignore that stubborn old man.

236
00:15:39,360 --> 00:15:41,520
<i>What he needs is a wife</i>
<i>who can run his household</i>

237
00:15:41,600 --> 00:15:42,760
<i>and manage the family estate,</i>

238
00:15:42,840 --> 00:15:45,120
<i>a proper principal wife</i>
<i>from a respectable family,</i>

239
00:15:45,200 --> 00:15:48,680
<i>not some celebrated Noble Lady</i>
<i>or a beautiful, seductive wife.</i>

240
00:15:51,640 --> 00:15:52,960
Greetings, Noble Lady Wu'an.

241
00:15:55,440 --> 00:15:57,400
Was Zhuo punished because of you?

242
00:15:57,480 --> 00:16:03,040
SHIZHAI

243
00:16:03,120 --> 00:16:04,360
Uncle died young.

244
00:16:04,880 --> 00:16:07,880
So the burden of the Duke's Residence
fell on Zhuo at an early age.

245
00:16:08,720 --> 00:16:11,000
And he's always been serious and reserved.

246
00:16:11,760 --> 00:16:13,760
He trains before dawn and studies at dawn.

247
00:16:14,640 --> 00:16:18,520
He works tirelessly every single day,
yet never once complains.

248
00:16:19,320 --> 00:16:23,200
As his wife,
it's your duty to stay by his side.

249
00:16:23,280 --> 00:16:25,200
How can you spend
every day at your estate?

250
00:16:25,280 --> 00:16:27,680
Do you know what people are saying?

251
00:16:29,240 --> 00:16:30,560
Saying what?

252
00:16:30,640 --> 00:16:33,440
Your estate is full of male scholars.

253
00:16:33,520 --> 00:16:38,920
Some people say you're an unfaithful wife
who's picking out lovers for yourself.

254
00:16:39,520 --> 00:16:43,400
Every prominent family in the capital
knows about the Wei family's past.

255
00:16:46,280 --> 00:16:48,520
But you didn't watch your behavior.

256
00:16:49,440 --> 00:16:51,800
You even encouraged Zhuo
to act recklessly.

257
00:16:51,880 --> 00:16:55,440
Do you know this is the first time
His Grace has ever reprimanded him?

258
00:17:05,680 --> 00:17:06,520
What?

259
00:17:07,800 --> 00:17:09,560
Afraid I'll use my authority
as Noble Lady Wu'an

260
00:17:10,240 --> 00:17:11,720
to have you seized and severely punished?

261
00:17:13,880 --> 00:17:15,480
I've always had a bad temper.

262
00:17:16,160 --> 00:17:17,960
And from now on, it'll only get worse.

263
00:17:18,880 --> 00:17:21,079
You can't afford to cross me.
So stay out of my way.

264
00:17:22,240 --> 00:17:25,000
Go. Take good care of Lu Zhuo.

265
00:17:25,079 --> 00:17:26,960
I won't stop you from fawning over him.

266
00:17:28,160 --> 00:17:32,040
He earned that glory on the battlefield
with his own blood!

267
00:17:32,840 --> 00:17:34,360
And you'll be the one to ruin it.

268
00:17:35,640 --> 00:17:36,640
Wei Rao,

269
00:17:37,720 --> 00:17:39,680
please leave my cousin alone.

270
00:17:46,000 --> 00:17:52,960
SHIZHAI

271
00:17:53,040 --> 00:17:58,680
ZUNSHAN SHRINE

272
00:18:08,360 --> 00:18:12,640
Your Ladyship, Noble Lady Wu'an sent back
both the physician and the medicine.

273
00:18:14,920 --> 00:18:16,640
She's my daughter, all right.

274
00:18:16,720 --> 00:18:19,200
Once she digs in her heels,
no one can change her mind.

275
00:18:19,280 --> 00:18:23,360
Your Ladyship, the palace
has sent messengers three times.

276
00:18:23,440 --> 00:18:25,520
His Majesty keeps urging you to return.

277
00:18:25,600 --> 00:18:26,480
What's the rush?

278
00:18:26,560 --> 00:18:29,000
There's still one important matter
I haven't dealt with.

279
00:18:29,080 --> 00:18:30,880
I'll explain it to him when I return.

280
00:18:32,440 --> 00:18:34,720
MAY THE FRAGRANCE ENDURE FOREVER

281
00:18:43,120 --> 00:18:45,000
After all the sins you've committed,

282
00:18:45,080 --> 00:18:47,160
no matter how devoutly you pray,

283
00:18:47,240 --> 00:18:49,440
why would heaven ever protect you?

284
00:18:50,760 --> 00:18:51,600
What?

285
00:18:51,680 --> 00:18:54,360
Here to mock me now that I've lost?

286
00:18:58,880 --> 00:19:02,560
Zhou Fu, do you really think
you've beaten me?

287
00:19:03,760 --> 00:19:06,120
The first time I saw her,

288
00:19:06,200 --> 00:19:09,840
I knew she was that child.

289
00:19:12,520 --> 00:19:17,600
Then I had a wonderful idea.

290
00:19:17,680 --> 00:19:20,880
I'd make the two of them mortal enemies.

291
00:19:20,960 --> 00:19:25,080
I wanted to see which one you'd kill.

292
00:19:26,120 --> 00:19:28,920
You and Wei Jin were once engaged,

293
00:19:30,000 --> 00:19:32,120
but you'd barely even met.

294
00:19:32,200 --> 00:19:36,400
So why do you hate me this much?

295
00:19:39,720 --> 00:19:43,120
Back then, I came from a powerful family.

296
00:19:43,200 --> 00:19:47,880
In the capital, I was known
for both beauty and talent.

297
00:19:47,960 --> 00:19:50,240
My parents searched far and wide

298
00:19:50,760 --> 00:19:57,320
and chose the most handsome
and talented young man in the capital.

299
00:19:58,120 --> 00:19:59,920
I was overjoyed.

300
00:20:04,080 --> 00:20:05,720
Wei Jin insisted on ending our engagement.

301
00:20:06,320 --> 00:20:08,800
He made me the laughingstock
of the capital.

302
00:20:08,880 --> 00:20:10,160
I was proud and headstrong.

303
00:20:10,760 --> 00:20:11,920
I tried to hang myself.

304
00:20:12,560 --> 00:20:15,280
To appease me,

305
00:20:15,360 --> 00:20:18,360
the Wei family offered me
as the Earl's principal wife.

306
00:20:19,480 --> 00:20:21,000
I agreed at once.

307
00:20:21,680 --> 00:20:24,760
All I wanted then was to marry
into the Wei family.

308
00:20:24,840 --> 00:20:29,760
I wanted Wei Jin to see
what kind of woman he'd missed out on.

309
00:20:30,360 --> 00:20:33,480
I wanted him to regret it
for the rest of his life.

310
00:20:34,560 --> 00:20:37,080
So you've resented me all this time.

311
00:20:38,000 --> 00:20:40,280
I thought you were the only one
in the Wei family

312
00:20:40,880 --> 00:20:44,560
who was decent and kindhearted.

313
00:20:44,640 --> 00:20:47,320
You were always so good to me.

314
00:20:47,400 --> 00:20:48,560
Back then,

315
00:20:48,640 --> 00:20:52,240
you were both in newlywed bliss.

316
00:20:52,320 --> 00:20:58,240
How could you ever notice
someone else suffering in silence?

317
00:20:59,000 --> 00:21:01,520
I regretted the moment
when I married into the Wei family.

318
00:21:01,600 --> 00:21:04,640
Wei Jin was clearly handsome,

319
00:21:05,160 --> 00:21:06,560
and gifted in both scholarship and combat.

320
00:21:06,640 --> 00:21:11,720
Yet his older brother was
a useless, lecherous fool.

321
00:21:12,440 --> 00:21:15,680
I'd been married less than three months,

322
00:21:15,760 --> 00:21:18,000
and not one of my maids

323
00:21:19,040 --> 00:21:22,480
escaped his advances.

324
00:21:23,160 --> 00:21:25,640
Disgusting. Shameless.

325
00:21:25,720 --> 00:21:28,880
A parasite obsessed with rank and status.

326
00:21:30,480 --> 00:21:34,480
Every time I saw him,
I wanted to throw up!

327
00:21:38,640 --> 00:21:43,520
So you hated me even more.

328
00:21:43,600 --> 00:21:46,120
When you were pregnant,

329
00:21:46,200 --> 00:21:51,000
I once went to Wei Jin's study
to bring him ginseng soup.

330
00:21:54,400 --> 00:21:56,240
Do you know what happened?

331
00:22:00,960 --> 00:22:05,080
A loving marriage? Faithful to each other?

332
00:22:06,440 --> 00:22:07,800
It's all a lie.

333
00:22:07,880 --> 00:22:10,120
All men are the same.

334
00:22:10,640 --> 00:22:13,680
Even the honorable Wei Jin
was no exception.

335
00:22:23,760 --> 00:22:27,920
He threw you out, didn't he?

336
00:22:35,040 --> 00:22:39,080
I thought he'd expose me,

337
00:22:39,160 --> 00:22:44,080
call me shameless
for seducing my husband's own brother,

338
00:22:44,160 --> 00:22:45,800
and ruin my reputation.

339
00:22:46,760 --> 00:22:49,400
But he… He simply walked out

340
00:22:50,920 --> 00:22:54,280
and quietly called my maid in.

341
00:22:55,520 --> 00:22:58,920
Afterward, he never told anyone.

342
00:22:59,800 --> 00:23:03,200
Instead, he went to
my family's home himself

343
00:23:03,280 --> 00:23:09,560
and brought my mother back
to talk some sense into me.

344
00:23:10,360 --> 00:23:12,120
You're insane.

345
00:23:13,680 --> 00:23:15,720
How could you do something like that?

346
00:23:15,800 --> 00:23:18,120
What if someone had found out?

347
00:23:18,200 --> 00:23:19,920
Did you ever think
what would happen to you?

348
00:23:20,000 --> 00:23:21,920
You were the ones who ruined my life!

349
00:23:22,000 --> 00:23:23,440
Why should I let you live happily?

350
00:23:23,520 --> 00:23:25,560
I meant to take everyone down with me!

351
00:23:25,640 --> 00:23:30,200
But Wei Jin was too foolish,
too honorable!

352
00:23:30,280 --> 00:23:33,360
He went to his older brother
and gave him a stern talking-to.

353
00:23:33,440 --> 00:23:36,440
He warned him again and again
to treat his wife well.

354
00:23:37,920 --> 00:23:40,600
It never even occurred to him

355
00:23:40,680 --> 00:23:46,320
that I had deliberately tried to ruin him.

356
00:23:48,240 --> 00:23:49,960
He was such a good man.

357
00:23:51,440 --> 00:23:55,000
Even someone as vicious as me

358
00:23:55,080 --> 00:23:58,320
couldn't bear to hurt him.

359
00:24:00,600 --> 00:24:03,680
But you… You!

360
00:24:04,760 --> 00:24:06,760
He died alone on the battlefield,

361
00:24:06,840 --> 00:24:09,640
in agony and despair.

362
00:24:10,280 --> 00:24:14,280
And you turned around and abandoned him,

363
00:24:14,360 --> 00:24:17,760
abandoned his daughter,
and sought favor with the Emperor!

364
00:24:17,840 --> 00:24:21,680
If heaven won't punish
a vicious woman like you,

365
00:24:21,760 --> 00:24:24,000
then I'll do it myself!

366
00:24:24,600 --> 00:24:25,920
I own what I've done.

367
00:24:26,880 --> 00:24:28,080
I won't deny it.

368
00:24:29,000 --> 00:24:32,200
If you hate me, come after me.

369
00:24:32,280 --> 00:24:35,280
Why did you hurt my child?

370
00:24:36,800 --> 00:24:39,520
You keep saying you never forgot Wei Jin.

371
00:24:40,040 --> 00:24:41,480
If he knew what you'd done,

372
00:24:41,560 --> 00:24:43,880
would he be thanking you
for hurting his only child?

373
00:24:45,560 --> 00:24:47,120
He'd only hate himself

374
00:24:47,800 --> 00:24:51,880
for ever showing kindness
to an ingrate like you.

375
00:24:52,400 --> 00:24:55,160
He'd want to kill you himself!

376
00:24:56,960 --> 00:24:58,040
Wei Jin…

377
00:25:04,080 --> 00:25:05,760
After all these years,

378
00:25:07,640 --> 00:25:13,240
do you really think
I never once suspected Madam Chang?

379
00:25:13,840 --> 00:25:15,720
I chose not to investigate.

380
00:25:16,840 --> 00:25:20,920
That was the greatest mercy
I could show you.

381
00:25:21,520 --> 00:25:24,800
Oh, please. You call that mercy?

382
00:25:25,400 --> 00:25:27,760
I saw through you long ago.

383
00:25:27,840 --> 00:25:30,440
You only dared bully a child.

384
00:25:30,520 --> 00:25:32,200
You never dared confront me.

385
00:25:33,080 --> 00:25:34,760
Because deep down,

386
00:25:35,280 --> 00:25:40,520
you're guilty, a coward,
and utterly useless.

387
00:25:42,280 --> 00:25:47,160
Have you forgotten
you have two daughters too?

388
00:25:48,240 --> 00:25:52,040
Before you did this,
didn't you think of them at all?

389
00:25:54,000 --> 00:25:56,160
If the truth ever came out,

390
00:25:56,240 --> 00:26:00,080
what do you think
I'd do to your daughters?

391
00:26:00,160 --> 00:26:02,960
M-My Shu is Prince Duan's wife.

392
00:26:03,640 --> 00:26:08,600
The married one
is harder to get to for now.

393
00:26:10,080 --> 00:26:11,520
But you still have Wei Chan.

394
00:26:12,600 --> 00:26:16,800
A young, lively girl
is bound to go out for spring outings.

395
00:26:17,680 --> 00:26:22,680
Maybe one day,
she'll end up just like my Rao

396
00:26:22,760 --> 00:26:27,440
and vanish without a trace in the capital.

397
00:26:44,480 --> 00:26:48,200
If you hurt either of them,
you'll kill Old Madam Wei!

398
00:26:49,040 --> 00:26:50,800
I don't want to go too far.

399
00:26:51,440 --> 00:26:53,360
I'll punish only
the one truly responsible.

400
00:26:54,160 --> 00:26:57,800
Lady Guo, I never want to see you again.

401
00:26:59,840 --> 00:27:03,400
Zhou Fu, you have His Majesty behind you,

402
00:27:03,480 --> 00:27:05,880
and the whole world is on your side.

403
00:27:06,920 --> 00:27:10,960
But I still
made a fool of you for sixteen years.

404
00:27:11,040 --> 00:27:13,880
Sixteen years apart from your daughter

405
00:27:13,960 --> 00:27:18,720
has filled her heart with resentment
she'll never let go of.

406
00:27:18,800 --> 00:27:22,720
That sixteen-year rift between you
can never be repaired!

407
00:27:22,800 --> 00:27:25,560
You think I've lost?

408
00:27:26,360 --> 00:27:28,680
You haven't won either.

409
00:27:28,760 --> 00:27:31,520
You've lost your daughter forever!

410
00:27:31,600 --> 00:27:33,920
That's victory enough for me!

411
00:27:37,480 --> 00:27:39,640
I may have wronged everyone,

412
00:27:39,720 --> 00:27:43,040
but I stayed true to the love I once had!

413
00:27:43,120 --> 00:27:46,120
Even after I die, I'll tell him

414
00:27:46,800 --> 00:27:49,960
that he was wrong about you

415
00:27:50,920 --> 00:27:55,520
and wrong about me…

416
00:27:59,640 --> 00:28:02,480
You were wrong about me.

417
00:28:03,000 --> 00:28:06,960
A wet nurse's daughter, a widow,
could still become an imperial consort.

418
00:28:08,200 --> 00:28:11,760
Guo Yufeng, I don't believe
what's broken can't be mended.

419
00:28:12,400 --> 00:28:16,760
I, Zhou Fu,
as long as I'm still breathing,

420
00:28:17,280 --> 00:28:21,320
will win my daughter back
and turn everything around.

421
00:28:22,520 --> 00:28:26,560
But you, you're already dead.

422
00:28:28,160 --> 00:28:29,840
No more chance for you.

423
00:29:09,600 --> 00:29:14,400
Grandmother, what did Mother do wrong
to be sent away to a convent?

424
00:29:15,000 --> 00:29:17,120
She's managed the Earl's Residence
all these years,

425
00:29:17,200 --> 00:29:18,800
and everyone there respects her.

426
00:29:18,880 --> 00:29:20,760
Didn't you always praise her

427
00:29:20,840 --> 00:29:23,160
as the most devoted daughter-in-law
in the capital?

428
00:29:23,240 --> 00:29:25,880
Why would you suddenly
send her to a convent for no reason?

429
00:29:25,960 --> 00:29:27,120
Please let Mother out.

430
00:29:27,720 --> 00:29:30,360
At the very least,
please let me go in and see her!

431
00:29:34,760 --> 00:29:37,600
Father. Please, think of all Mother
has done for this family.

432
00:29:37,680 --> 00:29:38,880
Put in a good word for her
with Grandmother.

433
00:29:39,480 --> 00:29:40,600
- Father…
- Get out of my way!

434
00:29:41,640 --> 00:29:42,800
Your mother spoiled you rotten.

435
00:29:42,880 --> 00:29:45,160
His Majesty spared me for failing
to control my household

436
00:29:45,240 --> 00:29:47,640
and letting my wife commit such crimes.
That's mercy enough.

437
00:29:47,720 --> 00:29:48,800
And you want me to plead for her?

438
00:29:49,400 --> 00:29:51,600
Do you want your father
stripped of his office and title?

439
00:29:52,800 --> 00:29:54,480
What a disgrace to this family.

440
00:29:55,080 --> 00:29:57,320
How did I marry such a shameless woman?

441
00:29:58,960 --> 00:30:01,920
Grandmother, please.

442
00:30:02,600 --> 00:30:05,080
Your mother made a grave mistake.

443
00:30:05,960 --> 00:30:07,280
She had to be punished.

444
00:30:08,360 --> 00:30:10,440
I wish I could help you too.

445
00:30:10,520 --> 00:30:12,280
Dowager Lady, terrible news!

446
00:30:13,440 --> 00:30:15,720
Dowager Lady, Lady Guo…

447
00:30:16,320 --> 00:30:18,040
She hanged herself at the convent!

448
00:30:20,360 --> 00:30:22,320
- Dowager Lady!
- Good riddance!

449
00:30:22,400 --> 00:30:23,560
- Death wipes away all sins.
- Dowager Lady!

450
00:30:24,160 --> 00:30:25,480
At least she had some shame left!

451
00:30:27,640 --> 00:30:28,600
LOTUS ROOM

452
00:30:28,680 --> 00:30:31,760
I'm going to Mother… I'm going to Mother!

453
00:30:32,440 --> 00:30:33,480
Chan!

454
00:30:34,920 --> 00:30:37,040
You… you…

455
00:30:37,560 --> 00:30:39,520
You heartless man!

456
00:30:40,920 --> 00:30:44,720
No matter what she did,
she was still your wife.

457
00:30:45,320 --> 00:30:47,720
You're beyond disgraceful!

458
00:30:48,400 --> 00:30:51,960
Shameless! Utterly shameless!

459
00:30:52,040 --> 00:30:54,160
Our earldom has endured for a century.

460
00:30:54,240 --> 00:30:57,320
How could I let a woman's crimes
destroy our family's reputation?

461
00:30:57,400 --> 00:30:58,880
Now that she's dead,

462
00:30:59,520 --> 00:31:03,240
Lady Li won't blame
the Earl of Cheng'an's Residence anymore.

463
00:31:03,760 --> 00:31:05,880
I did this for our family's future.

464
00:31:08,800 --> 00:31:13,760
Mother. We'll tell everyone
that she died of a sudden illness.

465
00:31:14,360 --> 00:31:16,320
Even when we notify
Prince Duan's Residence,

466
00:31:16,400 --> 00:31:18,160
we must keep the truth hidden.

467
00:31:20,960 --> 00:31:27,840
But Wei Shu is naturally
a very perceptive child.

468
00:31:29,480 --> 00:31:32,200
Her… Her mother died so suddenly.

469
00:31:33,320 --> 00:31:36,440
How could we possibly hide it from her?

470
00:31:38,880 --> 00:31:41,080
Why are you still sitting here?

471
00:31:41,160 --> 00:31:44,720
Hurry and bring Chan back!

472
00:31:44,800 --> 00:31:46,720
- Bring her back!
- I'll go right now!

473
00:31:46,800 --> 00:31:48,080
You…

474
00:31:50,200 --> 00:31:51,520
Don't worry, Dowager Lady.

475
00:31:53,080 --> 00:31:53,760
GRACE AND VIRTUE

476
00:31:53,840 --> 00:31:55,120
- Move!
- Who are you?

477
00:31:55,200 --> 00:31:56,560
- Lady Chan, help!
- How dare you seize people here?

478
00:31:56,640 --> 00:31:59,360
- Move! Hurry!
- Lady Chan, help!

479
00:31:59,440 --> 00:32:02,040
Governess Zheng, what's going on?

480
00:32:02,120 --> 00:32:05,040
- Wei Rao got Madam killed!
- Move! Hurry!

481
00:32:05,120 --> 00:32:06,720
Lady Li is the one
who got your mother killed!

482
00:32:06,800 --> 00:32:08,800
- Never forget that!
- What are you doing here?

483
00:32:08,880 --> 00:32:10,440
- Tell me! What are you doing?
- Father!

484
00:32:10,520 --> 00:32:11,920
Wei Rao got Mother killed!

485
00:32:12,000 --> 00:32:13,400
And Lady Li from the palace
was involved too!

486
00:32:13,480 --> 00:32:14,560
Tell me! Is it true?

487
00:32:14,640 --> 00:32:17,560
I'll tell you! I… I'll tell you!

488
00:32:19,400 --> 00:32:21,600
- Guards! Drag Lady Chan to her room!
- Hurry!

489
00:32:21,680 --> 00:32:22,840
- Without my order…
- Move!

490
00:32:22,920 --> 00:32:23,760
she is not to leave!

491
00:32:24,360 --> 00:32:25,800
- This isn't over!
- Hurry!

492
00:32:25,880 --> 00:32:26,840
I'll tell Shu!

493
00:32:26,920 --> 00:32:28,040
- Shu is Prince Duan's wife!
- Shut your mouth!

494
00:32:28,120 --> 00:32:30,320
- She'll avenge Mother!
- Take her away! Now!

495
00:32:30,400 --> 00:32:31,960
She'll never forgive you!

496
00:32:32,040 --> 00:32:34,120
I will tell Shu!

497
00:32:34,200 --> 00:32:35,040
GRACE AND VIRTUE

498
00:32:48,520 --> 00:32:52,200
My Lord, the physician said
you shouldn't be getting out of bed.

499
00:32:53,320 --> 00:32:55,160
- I'll get your medicine.
- No need.

500
00:32:56,520 --> 00:32:57,360
Where's Wei Rao?

501
00:32:58,960 --> 00:33:01,560
These injuries were partly for her sake.

502
00:33:03,520 --> 00:33:04,560
She hasn't even visited me.

503
00:33:07,120 --> 00:33:08,240
Her Ladyship is in the storeroom.

504
00:33:08,320 --> 00:33:10,040
- I'll get her right away.
- Wait.

505
00:33:11,560 --> 00:33:12,680
I'm this badly hurt,

506
00:33:13,280 --> 00:33:15,240
and she's still counting inventory?

507
00:33:16,320 --> 00:33:19,520
If I have to beg her to come,
she won't mean it anyway.

508
00:33:20,240 --> 00:33:21,280
Forget it.

509
00:33:24,880 --> 00:33:27,280
I told you not to go,
and you actually listened?

510
00:33:28,600 --> 00:33:30,000
Yes, My Lord. I'll go now.

511
00:33:30,600 --> 00:33:31,520
Wait.

512
00:33:33,120 --> 00:33:34,480
What will you tell her?

513
00:33:34,560 --> 00:33:38,080
I'll say your wound has gotten worse
and you've started talking nonsense.

514
00:33:39,160 --> 00:33:41,200
I'll ask Noble Lady Wu'an to come quickly.

515
00:33:45,640 --> 00:33:46,480
Why are you still here?

516
00:33:53,840 --> 00:33:55,240
Heartless woman.

517
00:34:09,880 --> 00:34:11,000
Finally here to see your husband?

518
00:34:14,320 --> 00:34:15,840
Zhuo, are you feeling better?

519
00:34:27,719 --> 00:34:29,960
I brought you some food.

520
00:34:30,679 --> 00:34:33,400
I hope your wounds heal soon.

521
00:34:34,000 --> 00:34:35,080
Take it away.

522
00:34:35,159 --> 00:34:37,040
I made all of this myself.

523
00:34:37,120 --> 00:34:38,360
Please, Zhuo, just try a bite.

524
00:34:38,440 --> 00:34:40,000
It'll help you recover too.

525
00:34:42,560 --> 00:34:45,000
My Lady,
His Lordship's injuries have gotten worse.

526
00:34:45,080 --> 00:34:46,760
He's been barely conscious.

527
00:34:50,520 --> 00:34:52,360
When I first came
to the Lu family at seven,

528
00:34:52,440 --> 00:34:54,679
you'd often check on me,

529
00:34:54,760 --> 00:34:57,640
ask how my studies were going,
and whether I needed anything.

530
00:34:58,240 --> 00:35:00,600
But as we grew older, you became distant.

531
00:35:00,680 --> 00:35:02,600
I only came
because I was worried about you,

532
00:35:02,680 --> 00:35:04,360
yet you keep driving me away.

533
00:35:04,440 --> 00:35:06,240
What did I do wrong?

534
00:35:06,760 --> 00:35:07,920
His Grace even had you whipped.

535
00:35:08,000 --> 00:35:11,040
I know perfectly well
who you're trying to protect.

536
00:35:11,880 --> 00:35:14,080
She's bad luck.

537
00:35:14,160 --> 00:35:16,360
Her father died the moment she was born.

538
00:35:16,440 --> 00:35:19,440
Sooner or later,
she'll get you killed too!

539
00:35:19,520 --> 00:35:20,880
Enough!

540
00:35:22,360 --> 00:35:23,600
How dare you speak ill of Wei Rao?

541
00:35:24,360 --> 00:35:25,800
My father died young too.

542
00:35:26,440 --> 00:35:29,320
Are you going to say I was born
to bring death to my father?

543
00:35:30,560 --> 00:35:31,520
What utter nonsense.

544
00:35:32,840 --> 00:35:35,480
When you came to the Lu family,
I treated you like my own sister.

545
00:35:36,080 --> 00:35:37,840
But I'm married now.

546
00:35:37,920 --> 00:35:40,080
If I'm sick, my wife will care for me.

547
00:35:41,120 --> 00:35:43,600
And if she can't,
I have attendants and medicine servants.

548
00:35:44,560 --> 00:35:46,040
It's not for an unmarried lady
like you to tend to me.

549
00:35:47,160 --> 00:35:50,000
Who let you in?
Who taught you such manners?

550
00:35:51,160 --> 00:35:52,280
Governess Miao.

551
00:35:54,160 --> 00:35:55,240
Governess Miao!

552
00:35:55,760 --> 00:35:56,840
Coming!

553
00:35:58,080 --> 00:35:59,560
What can I do for you, My Lord?

554
00:36:00,160 --> 00:36:01,400
I'm usually away with the army.

555
00:36:02,200 --> 00:36:03,600
Didn't know the ladies
were raised without discipline.

556
00:36:04,280 --> 00:36:06,400
One and the other alike.

557
00:36:06,480 --> 00:36:08,200
Ask Grandmother for permission.

558
00:36:08,960 --> 00:36:11,560
Tell her I'd like to borrow
Governess Li and Governess Bai from her.

559
00:36:13,120 --> 00:36:16,040
Starting tomorrow,
every young lady in this family

560
00:36:16,120 --> 00:36:17,640
will study etiquette
at Wanqing Pavilion at the Shen hour.

561
00:36:18,720 --> 00:36:19,640
Train them like soldiers.

562
00:36:19,720 --> 00:36:22,400
No meals until they get it right.
And cut off their allowances.

563
00:36:23,120 --> 00:36:24,400
Zhuo, my cousin.

564
00:36:24,480 --> 00:36:25,400
Especially the <i>Book of</i>
<i>Etiquette and Ceremonial.</i>

565
00:36:25,480 --> 00:36:27,160
Copy each chapter 100 times.

566
00:36:28,520 --> 00:36:29,880
Then they'll learn some manners.

567
00:36:31,800 --> 00:36:32,880
Anything else to say?

568
00:36:32,960 --> 00:36:35,360
Good advice is never welcome.
Kindness gets us nowhere.

569
00:36:36,400 --> 00:36:39,000
You keep taking her side.
Then I have nothing more to say!

570
00:36:40,240 --> 00:36:41,880
When she drags you down someday,

571
00:36:41,960 --> 00:36:43,640
I hope you won't regret it!

572
00:36:49,800 --> 00:36:50,840
Where is she?

573
00:36:51,960 --> 00:36:52,920
My Lord, do you mean…

574
00:36:55,720 --> 00:36:56,880
I didn't ask about anyone.

575
00:36:58,080 --> 00:36:59,120
Suit herself.

576
00:37:00,280 --> 00:37:02,960
She brought medicine before,
but His Lordship sent her away.

577
00:37:03,040 --> 00:37:04,920
Who knew she'd come back again today?

578
00:37:05,000 --> 00:37:07,040
I'll tell the gatekeepers
not to let her in again.

579
00:37:07,120 --> 00:37:09,400
What His Lordship does
has nothing to do with me.

580
00:37:09,920 --> 00:37:10,920
How could it not?

581
00:37:11,000 --> 00:37:13,360
Upsetting My Lady
would be a grave offense.

582
00:37:13,440 --> 00:37:15,320
This is all your fault! How irritating.

583
00:37:15,400 --> 00:37:17,080
- Stop following us!
- Well.

584
00:37:17,160 --> 00:37:20,280
Who has upset our Noble Lady Wu'an now?

585
00:37:20,360 --> 00:37:21,440
Fourth Aunt.

586
00:37:23,000 --> 00:37:23,840
Did you need me?

587
00:37:23,920 --> 00:37:26,080
Someone's been waiting outside
for you a long time.

588
00:37:26,160 --> 00:37:28,680
I came to ask if you really won't see her.

589
00:37:35,640 --> 00:37:38,800
Rao. The Empress Dowager
will return to the palace soon.

590
00:37:38,880 --> 00:37:41,000
It won't be easy for you two
to meet again.

591
00:37:41,640 --> 00:37:44,480
Whatever's on your mind,
why not ask her face-to-face?

592
00:37:45,200 --> 00:37:47,120
Don't bottle it up
and make yourself miserable.

593
00:37:47,200 --> 00:37:48,600
I have nothing to say to her.

594
00:37:49,640 --> 00:37:50,680
Rao.

595
00:37:51,760 --> 00:37:54,400
Think it through.
Don't rush your decision.

596
00:37:57,480 --> 00:37:59,520
I understand. Thank you.

597
00:38:00,240 --> 00:38:02,160
Then I'll quietly bring Her Ladyship in.

598
00:38:02,240 --> 00:38:03,840
You two can talk in Jiangyun Hall.

599
00:38:03,920 --> 00:38:05,040
That way, no one else will be disturbed.

600
00:38:07,080 --> 00:38:07,960
Let's go.

601
00:38:23,920 --> 00:38:30,160
JIANGYUN HALL

602
00:38:47,560 --> 00:38:48,440
Greetings, Your Ladyship.

603
00:38:59,320 --> 00:39:01,160
I heard you fell ill after you returned.

604
00:39:01,680 --> 00:39:05,000
It was only a chill. I'm fine now.

605
00:39:05,960 --> 00:39:07,360
Thank you for your concern, Your Ladyship.

606
00:39:10,720 --> 00:39:11,760
Rao.

607
00:39:13,320 --> 00:39:15,600
I won't let
what happened to you go unanswered.

608
00:39:16,360 --> 00:39:19,680
Lady Guo and Lady Heng'e
have both been severely punished.

609
00:39:19,760 --> 00:39:22,440
As for your adoptive mother
who deliberately deceived you,

610
00:39:22,960 --> 00:39:24,320
and the maid Bitao.

611
00:39:24,400 --> 00:39:25,880
Please, Your Ladyship,

612
00:39:25,960 --> 00:39:27,760
hand them over to me.

613
00:39:29,400 --> 00:39:30,320
All right.

614
00:39:31,400 --> 00:39:33,280
I'll have them sent to your estate.

615
00:39:34,160 --> 00:39:35,800
You may decide what to do with them.

616
00:39:38,680 --> 00:39:39,520
Rao.

617
00:39:40,960 --> 00:39:42,440
I'm returning to the palace.

618
00:39:43,760 --> 00:39:45,320
Before I leave,

619
00:39:46,680 --> 00:39:49,400
is there anything else I can do for you?

620
00:39:55,280 --> 00:39:56,760
Your Ladyship,

621
00:39:59,120 --> 00:40:00,440
why did you marry my father back then?

622
00:40:03,200 --> 00:40:05,440
His Majesty wanted me as his consort.

623
00:40:06,120 --> 00:40:08,960
But people mocked me for my background.

624
00:40:09,040 --> 00:40:09,880
GALAXY OF VERSES

625
00:40:09,960 --> 00:40:11,800
They looked down on me
and your maternal grandmother.

626
00:40:13,000 --> 00:40:15,760
I was young and proud then.
I refused to be looked down on.

627
00:40:17,400 --> 00:40:19,000
You married him out of defiance?

628
00:40:21,480 --> 00:40:24,240
Rao, I don't want to lie to you.

629
00:40:25,520 --> 00:40:27,400
Your father was skilled
in both scholarship and combat.

630
00:40:28,440 --> 00:40:30,360
He was famous throughout
the capital for his looks.

631
00:40:31,720 --> 00:40:33,200
If I was going to choose a husband,

632
00:40:33,280 --> 00:40:35,840
he'd either be the most powerful man alive

633
00:40:35,920 --> 00:40:37,960
or the finest man in the world.

634
00:40:39,080 --> 00:40:42,400
I never cared what people said about me.

635
00:40:42,480 --> 00:40:44,160
But you're my daughter.

636
00:40:44,240 --> 00:40:46,680
I swear to heaven,

637
00:40:47,760 --> 00:40:50,000
every day your father was alive,

638
00:40:51,080 --> 00:40:54,880
I loved him with all my heart
and was completely faithful to him.

639
00:41:02,600 --> 00:41:03,640
I understand.

640
00:41:09,800 --> 00:41:10,720
Rao,

641
00:41:11,840 --> 00:41:13,960
whatever you want,

642
00:41:15,520 --> 00:41:17,760
I will do everything
I can to make it up to you.

643
00:41:25,560 --> 00:41:26,960
There is one thing I want.

644
00:41:28,680 --> 00:41:30,040
I ask that you grant it, Your Ladyship.

645
00:41:39,920 --> 00:41:41,360
BRIGHT AS THE STARS

646
00:41:45,640 --> 00:41:46,680
Snap out of it.

647
00:41:48,160 --> 00:41:49,800
Snap out of it!

648
00:41:55,120 --> 00:41:57,160
You disappeared for four whole days.

649
00:41:57,240 --> 00:41:58,240
Even an imperial decree
couldn't bring you back.

650
00:41:58,840 --> 00:42:01,200
What other consort in this palace
gets such freedom?

651
00:42:01,280 --> 00:42:02,760
Are you still angry with me?

652
00:42:06,560 --> 00:42:08,280
Look. Take a good look.

653
00:42:10,760 --> 00:42:12,120
Your eyes are swollen from crying.

654
00:42:12,800 --> 00:42:16,320
You already have spies around me,
why bother asking?

655
00:42:18,640 --> 00:42:20,680
They're the ones
who deserve to be punished.

656
00:42:21,200 --> 00:42:23,240
And you've already punished
everyone who deserved it.

657
00:42:23,320 --> 00:42:26,280
They wronged you.
I never did anything to you.

658
00:42:30,560 --> 00:42:32,560
I'm not angry with you.

659
00:42:32,640 --> 00:42:33,840
I'm angry with myself.

660
00:42:35,560 --> 00:42:38,320
I thought keeping Rao away from me

661
00:42:38,400 --> 00:42:42,600
would spare her from palace intrigue
and let her grow up safe.

662
00:42:43,240 --> 00:42:45,400
I thought the Wei family
would treat her well.

663
00:42:45,480 --> 00:42:49,640
But who would've thought
that where I couldn't see,

664
00:42:49,720 --> 00:42:52,160
she'd suffer so much?

665
00:42:52,840 --> 00:42:56,960
I want to make the Wei family
pay for every bit of her suffering.

666
00:42:58,360 --> 00:43:01,680
From now on,
I don't care what anyone says.

667
00:43:02,320 --> 00:43:04,680
I'll keep Rao by my side and protect her.

668
00:43:04,760 --> 00:43:06,720
Let's see who dares lay a finger on her.

669
00:43:08,800 --> 00:43:09,840
Listen to yourself.

670
00:43:10,840 --> 00:43:12,560
You always blame everyone else.

671
00:43:13,440 --> 00:43:15,560
Are you yourself free of such bias?

672
00:43:15,640 --> 00:43:18,840
Enough. Rao is married now.

673
00:43:18,920 --> 00:43:20,640
Her husband will protect her.

674
00:43:24,760 --> 00:43:27,200
- Come here.
- Come on, tell me.

675
00:43:28,120 --> 00:43:29,200
What do you want?

676
00:43:30,240 --> 00:43:31,520
Sit.

677
00:43:34,440 --> 00:43:35,560
What do you want?

678
00:43:41,520 --> 00:43:42,480
Write.

679
00:43:43,680 --> 00:43:45,320
- Write what?
- A divorce agreement.

680
00:43:46,280 --> 00:43:47,280
Divorce?

681
00:43:48,640 --> 00:43:50,200
- Divorce?
- Did I burn you?

682
00:43:51,320 --> 00:43:53,440
I'm asking why you want a divorce.

683
00:43:56,080 --> 00:43:57,480
Have you forgotten, My Lord?

684
00:43:58,520 --> 00:44:01,480
When we first married,
we made an agreement.

685
00:44:03,240 --> 00:44:05,320
<i>We'd be husband and wife in name only.</i>

686
00:44:05,840 --> 00:44:08,560
A loving couple in public,
but living apart in private.

687
00:44:08,640 --> 00:44:12,160
No beating servants or killing innocents.

688
00:44:12,800 --> 00:44:14,040
And you would fulfill your duties
as principal wife.

689
00:44:15,040 --> 00:44:16,280
In front of others,

690
00:44:16,360 --> 00:44:17,960
I'd give you all the honor
and respect you were due.

691
00:44:18,560 --> 00:44:23,160
After one year,
we'd divorce and go our separate ways.

692
00:44:23,240 --> 00:44:26,400
We'd each be free to remarry,
with no ties between us.

693
00:44:27,720 --> 00:44:29,080
<i>If either of us broke our vow,</i>

694
00:44:29,160 --> 00:44:30,840
<i>we'd be struck by lightning</i>
<i>and burned by fire,</i>

695
00:44:30,920 --> 00:44:32,320
<i>then suffer the blade.</i>

696
00:44:37,360 --> 00:44:39,240
You swore it yourself, My Lord.

697
00:44:40,480 --> 00:44:43,520
That one day, if we broke our vow,

698
00:44:44,120 --> 00:44:45,560
we'd be struck by lightning
and burned by fire,

699
00:44:46,960 --> 00:44:48,160
then suffer the blade.

700
00:44:49,400 --> 00:44:51,040
The year isn't up yet.

701
00:44:51,120 --> 00:44:52,280
Why are you so eager to divorce me?

702
00:44:58,960 --> 00:45:00,200
How could I forget?

703
00:45:01,640 --> 00:45:02,680
You have your eye on Qi Zhongkai.

704
00:45:05,480 --> 00:45:08,680
General Qi and I are only friends now.

705
00:45:09,640 --> 00:45:10,720
For now?

706
00:45:11,880 --> 00:45:12,720
What about the future?

707
00:45:13,960 --> 00:45:16,880
As for the future, who knows?

708
00:45:22,280 --> 00:45:23,800
Our marriage was decreed
by the Empress Dowager.

709
00:45:24,640 --> 00:45:26,440
A sudden divorce could anger
the Imperial Family.

710
00:45:28,360 --> 00:45:30,120
You said that yourself.

711
00:45:30,200 --> 00:45:31,640
Things are different now.

712
00:45:32,240 --> 00:45:36,960
Lady Li promised me she'd ask
His Majesty to grant us permission.

713
00:45:39,080 --> 00:45:40,760
An imperial decree won't stop the gossip.

714
00:45:42,280 --> 00:45:43,800
Divorce won't hurt me.

715
00:45:43,880 --> 00:45:45,160
But it could ruin your reputation.

716
00:45:45,240 --> 00:45:47,520
People will surely speak ill of you
and spread vicious rumors.

717
00:45:47,600 --> 00:45:49,160
and drag your name through the mud.

718
00:45:49,240 --> 00:45:50,320
- So…
- Lu Zhuo.

719
00:46:03,160 --> 00:46:04,680
Can we just stay in this marriage?

720
00:46:26,400 --> 00:46:30,520
You're a true hero, and a true gentleman.

721
00:46:32,440 --> 00:46:35,360
You have the realm in your heart
and the weight of it on your shoulders.

722
00:46:36,880 --> 00:46:40,000
You deserve a wife from a noble family,

723
00:46:41,160 --> 00:46:42,880
a gentle and virtuous woman,

724
00:46:43,760 --> 00:46:44,840
not someone like me,

725
00:46:46,160 --> 00:46:49,560
who defies every rule
and does whatever she pleases.

726
00:46:53,640 --> 00:46:55,080
Who put these ideas in your head?

727
00:46:57,840 --> 00:46:59,080
You and I, are simply

728
00:47:01,840 --> 00:47:02,680
not right for each other.

729
00:47:22,880 --> 00:47:24,320
Perhaps I've failed you as a husband.

730
00:47:26,520 --> 00:47:28,840
That's why you cast me aside so easily.

731
00:47:33,960 --> 00:47:34,920
Wei Rao.

732
00:47:35,920 --> 00:47:37,600
I'm not a man you can just leave behind.

733
00:47:39,120 --> 00:47:40,720
Unless I agree,

734
00:47:42,680 --> 00:47:44,000
you won't leave the Lu family.

735
00:47:50,880 --> 00:47:52,440
The imperial decree
will arrive any moment.

736
00:47:52,520 --> 00:47:53,360
Think whatever you want.

737
00:47:54,480 --> 00:47:55,320
You…

738
00:48:02,720 --> 00:48:03,880
Lu Zhuo.

739
00:48:06,880 --> 00:48:08,120
Lu Zhuo.

740
00:48:09,080 --> 00:48:10,360
Someone, come!

741
00:48:14,360 --> 00:48:15,920
Someone!

742
00:48:17,520 --> 00:48:20,440
- My Lord!
- Lu Zhuo!

743
00:48:21,160 --> 00:48:22,200
- Lu Zhuo!
- My Lord!

744
00:48:22,880 --> 00:48:24,480
- Lu Zhuo!
- My Lord!

745
00:50:40,920 --> 00:50:43,920
‪NO ANIMALS WERE HARMED
‪IN THE MAKING OF THIS SHOW
